      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_language_b_07",
      "hash64": "F0BB465568903973",
      "text": "Phew. That seems to have done the trick just in\\nthe nick of time![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_language_b_08",
      "hash64": "F0BB535568904F8A",
      "text": "But this Pawmi doesn’t appear to belong to a\\nTrainer. Hmm... Could a wild Pokémon have\\r\\nwandered onto the academy grounds?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_language_b_09",
      "hash64": "F0BB54556890513D",
      "text": "Still, I can’t just leave it here alone without\\nanyone to make sure it’s OK.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
